 production time on each machine type in each month must not exceed available hours (two shifts, considering maintenance)", "formulation": "\sum_{p=1}^{P} Time_{p,m} \times Manufacture_{p,t} \leq WorkHours \times 2 \times 24 \times (NumMachines_{m} - Maintain_{m,t}), \quad \forall m, t", "code": {"gurobipy": "for m in range(M):
