{"parametrized_description": "The company’s declared objective is to minimize redundancy. Requirement are given as K different resources each having I specific requirements, where Strength is the strength of each type of resource, LessOneWaste is the value when wastage of resources is less than optimal, MoreOneWaste is the value when wastage of resources is more than optimal. Recruit is the number of recruited resources of each type, CostRedundancy is the cost of redundancy for each type of resource, NumOverman signifies the number of overmanned positions, CostOverman is the cost of overmanning for each type of resource, and NumShortwork represents the number of shortworked positions with CostShort as the cost of short working for each type of resource. How should they operate in order to do this?", "keywords": ["optimization", "minimization"], "parameters": {"K": {"description": "Total number of different types of resources", "shape": []}, "I": {"description": "Number of different requirements for each type of resource", "shape": []}, "Strength": {"description": "Strength of each type of resource", "shape": ["K"]}, "LessOneWaste": {"description": "Value when wastage of resources is less than optimal", "shape": ["K"]}, "MoreOneWaste": {"description": "Value when wastage of resources is more than optimal", "shape": ["K"]}, "Recruit": {"description": "Number of recruited resources of each type", "shape": ["K"]}, "CostRedundancy": {"description": "Cost of redundancy for each type of resource", "shape": ["K"]}, "NumOverman": {"description": "Number of overmanned positions", "shape": []}, "CostOverman": {"description": "Cost of overmanning for each type of resource", "shape": ["K"]}, "NumShortwork": {"description": "Number of shortworked positions", "shape": []}, "CostShort": {"description": "Cost of short working for each type of resource", "shape": ["K"]}, "Requirement": {"description": "Manpower requirements for each type of resource over the years", "shape": ["K", "I"]}}, "variables": {"RecruitNum": {"description": "Number of workers recruited in category k in year i", "type": "continuous", "shape": ["K", "I"]}, "Overmanning": {"description": "Number of overmanned workers in category k in year i", "type": "continuous", "shape": ["K", "I"]}, "Short": {"description": "Number of short-time workers in category k in year i", "type": "continuous", "shape": ["K", "I"]}, "Redundancy": {"description": "Number of workers made redundant in category k in year i", "type": "continuous", "shape": ["K", "I"]}}, "constraints": [{"description": "All decision variables must be non-negative", "formulation": "RecruitNum_{k,i} \geq 0, \quad Overmanning_{k,i} \geq 0, \quad Short_{k,i} \geq 0, \quad Redundancy_{k,i} \geq 0, \quad \forall k, i", "code": {"gurobipy": "for k in range(K):
