 "Produce_{k,t} + StockHold_{k,t-1} - StockHold_{k,t} - \sum_{j=1}^{NumIndustries} InputOne_{j,k} \times Produce_{j,t} - \sum_{j=1}^{NumIndustries} InputTwo_{j,k} \times BuildCapa_{j,t} \geq 0, \quad \forall k \in \{1, \ldots, NumIndustries\}, \forall t \in \{1, \ldots, NumYears\}", "code": {"gurobipy": "for k in range(NumIndustries):
