        model.addConstr(Produce[k][t] + stock_prev - StockHold[k][t] - quicksum(InputOne[j][k] * Produce[j][t] for j in range(NumIndustries)) - quicksum(InputTwo[j][k] * BuildCapa[j][t] for j in range(NumIndustries)) >= Demand[k], name=f"Demand_{k}_{t}")"}}, {"description": "Production cannot exceed productive capacity, which increases based on past capacity building", "formulation": "Produce_{k,t} \leq Capacity_{k} + \sum_{t'=1}^{t-2} BuildCapa_{k,t'}, \quad \forall k \in \{1, \ldots, NumIndustries\}, \forall t \in \{1, \ldots, K\}", "code": {"gurobipy": "for k in range(NumIndustries):
