    == (N - 1) + (W - 1), name="TotalFlow")"}}, {"description": "The number of north-south street segments used cannot exceed W", "formulation": "\text{Flow conservation at each interior node: } \sum_{\text{in}} flow = \sum_{\text{out}} flow \quad \forall \text{ interior nodes}", "code": {"gurobipy": "for n in range(N):
